<%- include('partials/head', { meta: { title: 'Accommodations', description: 'Two retreat settings: a private 200-acre camp in Northern Maryland and hotel conventions at Baltimore\'s Inner Harbor.' } }) %>
<body class="page-body">
<%- include('partials/nav') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/images/pavilion.jpg')"></div>
  <div class="page-hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="page-hero-content">
    <p class="t-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:14px">Where We Gather</p>
    <h1 class="t-title-lg">Our <em>Accommodations</em></h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="accom-section">

  <!-- Camp -->
  <div class="accom-block" id="camp">
    <div class="accom-inner fade-up">
      <div class="accom-imgs">
        <div class="accom-img-main">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1441974231531-c6227db76b6e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=80" alt="Maryland woodland camp" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <img src="/images/cabin-interior.jpg" alt="Cabin interior" loading="lazy">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504280390367-361c6d9f38f4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=500&q=80" alt="Campfire evenings" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="accom-type">Spring &amp; Summer Retreats</p>
        <h2 class="t-title-md accom-title" style="color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--font-serif)">Private Camps<br>Northern Maryland &amp; California Sierra Nevada</h2>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc">Our Spring and Summer Retreats are held at two private camp locations — a 200-acre facility in Northern Maryland, and a camp in the California Sierra Nevada. Both settings offer the same intimate, immersive Odyssey experience.</p>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc" style="margin-top:12px">The Maryland site is minutes from I-95 and is easily reached from New York and Washington DC. The retreat is also accessible by public transportation. If you are flying, the best airport is Baltimore Washington International (BWI). We recommend renting a car for the 30-minute drive north — though shuttles and carpooling options are available after registration.</p>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc" style="margin-top:12px">The Sierra Nevada site is roughly 2.5 hours from the Bay Area. You can fly into SFO, Oakland, or San Jose — Sacramento also works and is about 2 hours away. There is no shuttle service, so you'll need to rent a car.</p>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc" style="margin-top:12px">Food service and accommodations are similar at both venues. Meal plans are optional but highly recommended.</p>
        <div class="accom-amenities">
          <span class="amenity-pill">Private cabins</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Real beds &amp; mattresses</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Full bathrooms</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Hot showers</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Electricity</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Swimming pool</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Private lake</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Nightly bonfires</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Miles of hiking trails</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">200+ acres</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Tent camping option</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Meal plan optional (recommended)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Hotel -->
  <div class="accom-block" id="hotel">
    <div class="accom-inner reverse fade-up">
      <div class="accom-imgs">
        <div class="accom-img-main">
          <img src="/images/baltimore-winter.jpg" alt="Baltimore Inner Harbor skyline" loading="lazy">
        </div>
        <img src="/images/hotel-travel-couple.jpg" alt="Couple traveling to a convention" loading="lazy">
        <img src="/images/hotel-pool.jpg" alt="Hotel pool" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="accom-type">Fall &amp; Winter Conventions</p>
        <h2 class="t-title-md accom-title" style="color:var(--ink); font-family:var(--font-serif)">Hotel Conventions<br>Baltimore &amp; San Jose</h2>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc">Our Fall and Winter Conventions are larger hotel-based events held at Baltimore's Inner Harbor. These gatherings broaden our focus and deal with both interpersonal relationships as well as wider community and social topics.</p>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc" style="margin-top:12px">For Baltimore, we recommend Baltimore/Washington International (BWI) if you are flying. Transportation is easy — grab the MARC train to the station directly across from the hotel, or take an Uber for approximately $30.</p>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc" style="margin-top:12px">For San Jose, fly into San Jose Airport or SFO, then take an Uber to the hotel.</p>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc" style="margin-top:12px">Room rates are $165/night plus taxes in Baltimore and $180/night plus taxes in San Jose, for a King or Double Queen room. A 72-hour cancellation policy applies.</p>
        <p class="t-body-warm accom-desc" style="margin-top:12px">After you register, our hotel coordinator will be in touch to assist with your room reservation and answer any travel questions.</p>
        <div class="accom-amenities">
          <span class="amenity-pill">Baltimore &amp; San Jose hotels</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">King or Double Queen rooms</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">$165/night Baltimore + tax</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">$180/night San Jose + tax</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">72-hour cancellation policy</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">MARC train accessible (Baltimore)</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Uber from BWI or SJC/SFO</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Expanded programming</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Day passes available</span>
          <span class="amenity-pill">Hotel coordinator support</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-watermark">GATHER</div>
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <p class="t-eyebrow cta-eyebrow on-light">Reserve Your Spot</p>
    <h2 class="t-title-lg cta-title">Choose your setting.</h2>
    <p class="cta-body">Whether you prefer the privacy of the Maryland woodland or the energy of Baltimore's Inner Harbor, there is a retreat designed for you.</p>
    <div class="btn-group cta-group">
      <a href="/registration" class="btn btn-gold">View Dates &amp; Register</a>
      <a href="/faq" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Read the FAQ</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
<script src="/js/main.js?v=<%= site.version %>"></script>
</body>
</html>
